      <h2 class="section-title">8. Calibration &amp; Governance</h2>
      <ul class="muted">
        <li>Run patterns in shadow mode alongside manual patterns.</li>
        <li>Track which patterns produce qualified responses and screens.</li>
        <li>Promote winners into a shared template library.</li>
        <li>Version templates; restrict core taxonomy edits to Ops.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

